<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>E Button Used </Major>
    <Description>AFK Pickaxe Pressing E for you
Mining with Pickaxe.
Very easy and straight to the point . You must be Online in order for macro to work.

How to use :
1. Go to a Quarry.
2. When you See button E showing up
3. Near the rocks , activate macro !</Description>
    <Comment>This will not solve your captcha</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 3 s
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 5346 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 8 s
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>